cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "RLAttack: a simulation observatory for reinforcement-learning attack paths"
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - name: "AI Security Lab Contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/MintKangaroo/RLattack"
license: MIT
version: 0.5.0
date-released: "2026-08-29"
keywords:
  - reinforcement-learning
  - cybersecurity
  - attack-graph
  - simulation
abstract: >-
  RLAttack is a simulation-only research environment for studying reinforcement-learning
  policies over synthetic attack graphs. It never performs network access, subprocess
  execution, or interaction with real systems.
